  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「毎日十五時、十五分休止(七世界共通)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あの休止札が、ほこりをかぶる暇のない毎日になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただし、うちの十五分休止には、名物がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休止札を立てた瞬間、落とし物たちが「今だ」と休憩室へ詰めかけてくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "竜の長靴、月の傘、海底王の冠、三つの時計。全員、カシムさんのそばで休みたいらしい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本日も、満員です。……休憩室が、七世界で一番混む部屋になるとは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "人望です。物望?　……とにかく、慕われてる証拠です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "騒がしい休憩室の中央で、今日も紅茶を飲む。砂時計は十四分ぶんが落ちた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カシムさんが立ち上がって、七つの扉に金の鎖をかけた。受付ベルに、そっと布をかぶせた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.direction.005",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.asset.still.003"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "残り、一分。——ここからは、七世界にも、受付はさせません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最後の一分は、いつも二人だけの時間。ベルは鳴らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉は開かない。落とし物たちも、心得た顔で静かになる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "無限の受付ができる人が、その全部を止めて守る、たった一分。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……この一分で、何回でも聞きますけど。休むの、もう怖くないですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "怖いですよ、今でも。……ですが、この一分の砂の音を聞くと、思い出すのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私が止まっても、世界は待っていてくれると。——あなたが、証明してくれた分だけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届は、先週出した。演目「公開・十五分休止(七世界のお客様、立ち会い歓迎)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "備考欄が、彼らしかった。「残り一分は、非公開です」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "砂時計の最後のひと粒が落ちる。彼は布を外し、鎖を解き、受付の顔に戻る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「次のお客様、どうぞ」その声が、七世界で一番良い声をしてる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.epilogue.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "非公開の一分を知っている私だけが、耳の熱さで知っている。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "cassim-bell.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
